@startuml 12-sequence-retour
' UML sequence diagram: a Retour, with the mandatory client signature (US-070 to US-075, US-044).
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>0."

actor "Staff" as staff
actor "Client" as client
participant "App\n(iPhone)" as app
participant "API +\nPostgreSQL" as api
participant "Storage" as st
participant "Documenso" as doc

== Open the rental · US-070 ==
staff -> app : « Retour », choose the active rental
app -> api : load the contract as last amended, departure data, open damage
api --> app : data + photo links (≤ 5 min)

== Check-in · US-071 to US-073 ==
staff -> app : return time, km in, fuel in
app -> app : km driven, extra km
alt new damage
  loop each new damage
    staff -> app : at least one photo + a comment
    app -> st : upload the photos (insert-only, presigned)
    app -> api : save as open damage, linked to this Retour
  end
else nothing new
  staff -> app : « RAS »
end
staff -> app : final pricing lines, typed by hand
app -> api : Retour saved as it is typed (in progress)

== Signature, mandatory · US-074, US-075 ==
alt client present
  app -> api : preview of the final PDF, FR or EN (switchable)
  api -> api : render: departure image in « Signature départ »,\nexcept amendment pages
  api -> doc : envelope: a field in « Signature retour » on every page
  app -> client : Documenso's signing page, private web view
  client -> doc : signs once (F-17)
  doc -> api : webhook: document completed
  activate api #F6EFDC
  api -> st : store the sealed final PDF, SHA-256
  api -> api : one transaction (complete_return):\ninspection · final amounts · signature evidence\ncar km and fuel · contract closed · car available · audit
  deactivate api
  app -> st : download the sealed PDF
  app -> staff : iOS share sheet
else client absent
  app -> staff : « Retour en attente de signature »
  note right of app : The envelope waits. The contract stays active\nand the car « En cours ». The company contacts\nthe client (B-08); the Retour ends when they sign.
end
@enduml
